Option 2: Model of the Month
Everyone uses the same model for 2–4 weeks.
Collect feedback:
Code quality
Speed
Hallucinations
PR review comments
Reevaluate monthly.

This helps the team learn together and compare models fairly.

Option 3: Task-Based Standards

Instead of one model for everything:

Feature development → Model A
Debugging → Model B
Documentation → Model C

Create a short guide so everyone knows what tends to work best.
